        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlomeeji mu Tesalonike",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūgendo lwabo būbītīla Ampifoli na Apolonia, būūkashika Tesalonike, lyalīko isinagogi lya Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Paulo ūshisha sabato idatū akwingīlaga mo wahoya nabo mihayo ya mu shandīkwa, gīt'ūmo wītīlaga na kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabakundūlīlaga na kūboolekeja hape, gīkī yalī īng'wigelile ū Kilisito aluhiwe na kūjūūka kūfuma mu bafu. Ūbawīla gīkī, “Ū Yesu ūyo nalīmusomboolela mhola jakwe ng'wenūyū, hūna ng'wene ū Kilisito.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamò babo bakagūloleela bizunīlīja nabo a ba Paulo nū Sila; ū mu benabo baalīmo na Bayunani bingī, abo baalī balamya ba ng'wa Mulungu, hamò n'iganda lya bakīma bakūjiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a Bayudaya bakabona wilu, būsoleleja ibita lya banhū bahūnga kūfuma ng'wigūlilū. Aho balībilinga ī libita lyenīlo, bandya nsambo ū mu nzengo. Biza ha ng'wa Yasoni badaalulaga, balībakooba gīkī babafunīje hanze kū banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho babagayiwa hoi, būndutanja ū Yasoni hamò na badūgū bangī, būbatwala kū basugi ba nzengo; kūnū balīyoganya balīhaya gīkī, “Baashikile nū kūūnū a banhū abo bakūjaga būyugagūla sī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū Yasoni h'ūyo wabanukūlile. Alīyo bashidalahile ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa Kaisali, bakūhayaga gīkī angū alīho ntemi ūngī Yesu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbayuugagūla a banhū na a batongeeji aho bīyigwa ī mihayo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būmbiisha ihyū ū Yasoni na a biye, hūna būbalekela būja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Beloya kūlomeelwa mhayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ī būjikū, a badūgū būbafunya a ba Paulo nū Sila, būbatwala Beloya; aho bashika ko bingīla ng'wisinagogi lya Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bene baalī balembeezu kūtinda a bana Tesalonike, bakagwanukūla ū mhayo na būkalalwa bose, būyūshilola ī shandīkwa būlī lūshikū, babone ūlū īlī gīko ī mihayo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bingī bakazunya, bamò baalī bakīma bakūjiwa ba Shiyunani, na a bagosha nabo baalī batī bagehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bayudaya ba Tesalonike aho bigwa gīkī ū Paulo akūgūlomeelaga ū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu nī Beloya, būja nū kwene, būūkabayugagūla na kūbazwanja a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo haho na haho a badūgū būng'wīnja ū Paulo būja nang'hwe kū ng'walo gwa nyanza, būneka ū Sila nū Timotheo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakaja nū Paulo bakajūshika nang'hwe Atene. Aho wamala kūbalagīja gīkī bakabawīle a ba Sila nū Timotheo bangūhe ū kwiza ū kūlī we, a boi būshoka Beloya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo mu Atene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Paulo aho alī mu nzengo gwa Atene abalindīīlile a biye, akabona mo mbika na mbika ja shiikolile sha kūlamiwa; ū mhayo gwenūyo gūnkoya no ū mu moyo gokwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyingīla ng'wisinagogi lya Bayudaya wahoya nabo, hamò na a bangī abo bizaga mo kūlamya. Na kwigūlilū wajaga būlī lūshikū wakahoya na a babo baalīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalīho na basomi bataale, bitanagwa Baepikuleo na Bastoiko; bamò babo aho bamanhya nang'hwe ū Paulo būyūhaya gīkī, “Ū ng'halahala ūyū nang'hwe ni alīgaagaana kūhaya kī shi?” Bangī būyūhaya gīkī, “Alībiza giti Nomeeji wa mihayo ya bamulungu bageni!” Bakahaya gīko nguno ū Paulo wabalomeelaga ng'hūlū ja ng'wa Yesu na ja būjūūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose banoga būndima, būntwala kwinumba lyabo lya kwibilingīla litanagwa Aleo-Pago; būūkamūja kwenūko gīkī, “Bebe a malange ayo ūlīlanga genaya mapya, tūdūgije kūgamana nise? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī mihayo īyo ūlītwenhela yenīyī, migeni gete ū mu matū gise! Na lūūlū tūlī na ng'hūmbū ja kūgamana a makūlū gayo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pye a bana Atene na a bageni abo bikalaga mo baalī batī na gwa kwīta gūngī, ūlū ītī kwiyinha sūūsū dūhū, nūūlū kūdegeleka mihayo migeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbūūka ū Paulo wīmīīla ū ng'winumba lya Aleo-Pago; ūhaya gīkī, “Bababa bana Atene, nalībona a bing'we mukalalilwe no ī mihayo ya dini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mu kūbīta bīta kwane, būlī kwene ūlū nalola nakwībonaga ī mihayo ya kalamīje king'we. Naabītile na kūbona wandīke ha ng'walīlo nebe būhayile gīkī, ‘Kūlī Mulungu ūyo atamanīkile.’ Ali lūūlū, ū nene nalīmulanja ūyo mukanamyaga mu būtūmana ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ū Meeja wa sī nī shose īsho shilīmo, atikalaga mu maduku ga kūbeejiwa na makono, nguno ū wei hū Seeba w'igūlū na sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo atagongile kūtūmamīlwa na makono gītī gīkī ngayiwa, nguno hū ng'wene ūyo akabinhaga pye a bose ū būpanga nī myūyī, nī shikolo ī shingī pyī ūmo shigelelile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ng'wene ūyo akagabeeja pye a mahanga ga banhū kūfuma mulī munhū ūmò, gīkī bīsambaalīle pyī ī sī, bazenge mo. Ūbatūūlīla na makanza, nī mbīmbī, mihayo īyo īhelilwe kūfuma kale kūlwa wikalo wabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīkī bayūbbabbasha bbabbasha, nose bampandīke ū Mulungu, nūūlū īkī atī kūle na būlī ūmò wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mulī we h'ūmo būlī ū būpanga wise, nū kūyeela yeelaga kwise kūlī mulī we. Pyī nū būmunhū wise h'ūmo būlī, gīt'ūmo na bamò ba bīmbi bing'we bakahayīlaga gīkī, ‘Na a bise tūlī shiseeng'wa shakwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose īkī tūlī shiseeng'wa sha ng'wa Mulungu, tūtiziganika gīkī ū Mulungu ashikile kwikolanījiwa na shikolo gītī zahabu nūūlū feza, nūūlū mawe ga mpango ntaale ayo gakabeejiagwa na būgaliili bo banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu makanza ga būtūmana, ū Mulungu walī abalekile dūhū a banhū, alīyo ī haha alībalagīla pye a banhū hose hose gīkī bagalūke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno lūlīho lūshikū alūtūūlile, lo kūbalamula pye a banhū mu būtūngīlīja, mu nzīla ya ng'wa Munhū ūyo ansolile we. Ū Mulungu akanjūūcha ū Munhū ng'wenūyo kūfuma mu bafu, ūboolekeja hape pye a banhū gīkī akūgūshikīlīja ū mhayo gwenūyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
